  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">State Admission Programme of Brandenburg for Beneficiaries of International Protection with Specific Protection Needs from Jordan to Germany in 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The German state of Brandenburg implements a humanitarian admission programme for beneficiaries with specific protection needs out of Jordan. The project assists 400 beneficiaries of international protection who will be admitted by Brandenburg. IOM will provide comprehensive support to the admission program, including facilitation of the visa process, provision of pre-departure orientation sessions, migration health assessments, determination of fitness to travel, and movement assistance before and during departure, at transit and upon arrival.</narrative>
  </description>
